      55.53,
      476.65,
      547.24,
      526.72
    ],
    "text": "IN accordance with the provisions of Section 28 of the Wages Boards Ordinance (Chapter 136) the Wages Board for theGarments Manufacturing Trade hereby notifies that the Board, by virtue of the powers vested in it by Section 30 of theaforesaid Ordinance, proposes to vary in the manner set out in the Schedule hereto such decisions of the Board as arespecified in that schedule.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      85.53,
      541.69,
      547.06,
      552.76
    ],
    "text": "Objections to the aforesaid proposal will be received by the Chairman of the Board until 12.00 noon on 02nd July 2018.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.53,
      567.73,
      547.21,
      591.76
    ],
    "text": "Every such objection must be made in writing and must contain a Statement of grounds upon which such objection istaken.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
